		(descr "XL-5050RGBC (Xinglight) SMD5050 6-pin RGB LED footprint. Pad layout VERIFIED against manufacturer datasheet (misc/c7b4bb8841da5973ba31f9cd1a1b23d8.pdf, page 9 Outline Dimension): 3 pads on left edge (4=G anode,5=R anode,6=B anode top-to-bottom), 3 pads on right edge (3=G cathode,2=R cathode,1=B cathode top-to-bottom). Body 5.0x5.0mm, pads 1.3x1.2mm, pad-center span 4.4mm(X)/3.4mm(Y, 1.7mm pitch). Pin 1 = bottom-right (B cathode).")
